OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds without water due to
OL,4,Aburst main
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people are having to use
OL,7,Fbottled water in a West Sussex town
OL,8,Fafter a water main burst.
OL,10,FSouth East Water apologised to
OL,11,Fcustomers in Hassocks after it spotted
OL,12,Fthe leak on Friday night.
OL,14,FThe firm said work to fix the problem,
OL,15,Fwhich had been completed, was "complex"
OL,16,Fbecause it was on a bend and the
OL,17,Fcondition of the ground was
OL,18,F"difficult".
