OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds without water due to
OL,4,Aburst main
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said earlier there were 686
OL,7,Fcustomers without water but that
OL,8,Fservice would be restored by Saturday
OL,9,Fevening.
